Keep in mind that we've heard nothing from UFC President and CEO Dana White about accepting a job as White House press secretary or if he's even interested, but President Donald Trump did extend the invitation in a Truth Social post.
BREAKING: President Trump announces he has offered the White House Press Secretary job to UFC President Dana White.
